{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 14, :comments ["<b>And the uncircumcised male.</b> Here it teaches that circumcision is in that place by which a male is distinguished from a female (Bereshit Rabbah)." "<b>Whoever is not circumcised.</b> From when he reaches the age of punishments he is cut off; but his father is not punished with karet, though he transgresses a positive commandment." "<b>That soul shall be cut off.</b> He goes childless and dies before his time (Shabbat 24)."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 17, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:59:01.863706129Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}